# Line-ending law (h69). The repo is edited from Windows and from Linux
# agents; without this, whole-file CRLF flips bury real diffs (a 5,328-line
# no-op diff on game.js prompted this). Code normalizes to LF; Windows batch
# files MUST stay CRLF or cmd.exe silently misparses them.
* text=auto
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
